INSERT INTO `legal_document_templates` VALUES ('consumer','Consumer Complaint','bi-bag-check','#10b981','TEMPLATE',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-02 18:13:57','CONSUMER COMPLAINT\n\nDate: {date}\n\nTo,\nThe Concerned Consumer Grievance Authority,\n{city}\n\nSubject: Consumer Complaint - {subject}\n\nDear Sir/Madam,\n\nI, {name}, residing at {address}, wish to raise a complaint concerning a product or service.\n\nDetails of the issue:\n\n{details}\n\nIncident / Transaction Date: {incident_date}\n\nAdditional Information:\n{extra}\n\nI request that the complaint be considered and appropriate redressal be provided in accordance with applicable consumer law.\n\nContact: {contact}\nEmail: {email}\n\nThank you.\n\nYours faithfully,\n{name}','National Consumer Helpline (NCH): https://consumerhelpline.gov.in/ . Consumer grievances can be registered through the NCH web portal and other channels. Where appropriate, consumers may also use the relevant Consumer Commission mechanism.','Identity/contact details|Invoice, bill or receipt|Warranty or guarantee documents where applicable|Order or transaction details|Communication with seller or service provider|Photographs or other evidence of the defect or issue','Collect the purchase and transaction records|Register the grievance with the National Consumer Helpline where appropriate|Keep the complaint/reference number|Use the appropriate Consumer Commission mechanism when further formal redressal is required','Invoice or receipt attached|Warranty document attached where applicable|Seller/service-provider communication attached|Evidence of defect or issue attached|Complaint/reference number saved'),('cyber','Cyber Crime Complaint','bi-shield-lock','#7c3aed','TEMPLATE',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-02 18:13:57','CYBER CRIME COMPLAINT\n\nDate: {date}\n\nTo,\nThe Cyber Crime Police / Appropriate Law Enforcement Authority,\n{city}\n\nSubject: Cyber Crime Complaint - {subject}\n\nDear Sir/Madam,\n\nI, {name}, residing at {address}, wish to report a cybercrime incident.\n\nDetails of the incident:\n\n{details}\n\nIncident Date: {incident_date}\n\nAdditional Information:\n{extra}\n\nI request that the incident be examined and appropriate action be taken.\n\nContact: {contact}\nEmail: {email}\n\nThank you.\n\nYours faithfully,\n{name}','National Cyber Crime Reporting Portal: https://www.cybercrime.gov.in/ . For cyber financial fraud, the official portal advises immediate reporting through helpline 1930. In an emergency or for a non-cyber crime, contact the local police/emergency service.','Identity proof|Incident date and time|Incident details|Relevant screenshots or images|Emails, messages or URLs where applicable|Bank, wallet or merchant details and transaction/UTR information for financial fraud|Other relevant digital evidence','Preserve the original digital evidence|Report the incident through the National Cyber Crime Reporting Portal|For financial cyber fraud, report immediately through 1930|Keep the complaint/reference number for tracking','Identity proof ready|Incident details recorded|Screenshots or digital evidence attached|Transaction details attached if applicable|Complaint/reference number saved'),('doc_52b63bd4fdec4479ae83','Workplace Complaint','bi-briefcase','#f59e0b','DOCUMENT','workplace',5,'WORKPLACE COMPLAINT\n\nDate: ________________\n\nTo,\nThe Internal Committee / Appropriate Workplace Authority,\n________________\n\nSubject: Workplace Complaint - ________________\n\nDear Sir/Madam,\n\nI, ________________, wish to submit a complaint concerning the following workplace matter:\n\n________________\n\nIncident Date: ________________\n\nAdditional Information:\n________________\n\nI request that the matter be examined and dealt with through the appropriate workplace grievance or complaint mechanism.\n\nContact: ________________\nEmail: ________________\n\nThank you.\n\nYours faithfully,\n________________','2026-09-10 11:05:18','2026-09-10 11:05:18',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),('doc_7db36fe69cc64ce8b6d7','Cyber Crime Complaint','bi-shield-lock','#7c3aed','DOCUMENT','cyber',27,'CYBER CRIME COMPLAINT\n\nDate: ________________\n\nTo,\nThe Cyber Crime Police / Appropriate Law Enforcement Authority,\n________________\n\nSubject: Cyber Crime Complaint - ________________\n\nDear Sir/Madam,\n\nI, ________________, residing at ________________, wish to report a cybercrime incident.\n\nDetails of the incident:\n\n________________\n\nIncident Date: ________________\n\nAdditional Information:\n________________\n\nI request that the incident be examined and appropriate action be taken.\n\nContact: ________________\nEmail: ________________\n\nThank you.\n\nYours faithfully,\n________________','2026-10-02 20:46:33','2026-10-02 20:46:33',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),('doc_df12619b89154022a9e9','Cyber Crime Complaint','bi-shield-lock','#7c3aed','DOCUMENT','cyber',15,'CYBER CRIME COMPLAINT\n\nDate: ________________\n\nTo,\nThe Cyber Crime Police / Appropriate Law Enforcement Authority,\n________________\n\nSubject: Cyber Crime Complaint - ________________\n\nDear Sir/Madam,\n\nI, sneha, residing at manali, wish to report a cybercrime incident.\n\nDetails of the incident:\n\n________________\n\nIncident Date: ________________\n\nAdditional Information:\n________________\n\nI request that the incident be examined and appropriate action be taken.\n\nContact: ________________\nEmail: ________________\n\nThank you.\n\nYours faithfully,\nsneha','2026-09-11 18:36:31','2026-09-11 18:36:31',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),('general','General Complaint','bi-file-earmark-text','#4f46e5','TEMPLATE',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-02 18:13:57','GENERAL COMPLAINT\n\nDate: {date}\n\nTo,\nThe Concerned Authority,\n{city}\n\nSubject: {subject}\n\nDear Sir/Madam,\n\nI, {name}, residing at {address}, wish to submit this complaint regarding the following matter:\n\n{details}\n\nIncident Date: {incident_date}\n\nAdditional Information:\n{extra}\n\nI request the concerned authority to examine the matter and take appropriate action in accordance with the applicable rules and procedure.\n\nContact: {contact}\nEmail: {email}\n\nThank you.\n\nYours faithfully,\n{name}','Submit this complaint to the concerned department, local authority or other appropriate authority depending on the subject of the grievance. For a grievance relating to government service delivery, CPGRAMS may be used.','Identity proof|Copy of complaint|Relevant receipts, records or documents|Photographs or other supporting evidence where applicable','Submit the complaint to the appropriate authority|Keep a copy of the submitted complaint and acknowledgement/reference number|Follow up through the applicable grievance mechanism','Complaint copy ready|Identity proof attached|Supporting documents attached|Acknowledgement/reference number recorded'),('public','Public Service Complaint','bi-building','#06b6d4','TEMPLATE',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-02 18:13:57','PUBLIC SERVICE COMPLAINT\n\nDate: {date}\n\nTo,\nThe Concerned Government Department / Public Authority,\n{city}\n\nSubject: Public Service Grievance - {subject}\n\nDear Sir/Madam,\n\nI, {name}, residing at {address}, wish to submit a grievance regarding the delivery of a public service.\n\nDetails of the grievance:\n\n{details}\n\nIncident / Service Date: {incident_date}\n\nAdditional Information:\n{extra}\n\nI request the concerned authority to examine the grievance and take appropriate action.\n\nContact: {contact}\nEmail: {email}\n\nThank you.\n\nYours faithfully,\n{name}','Centralized Public Grievance Redress and Monitoring System (CPGRAMS): https://pgportal.gov.in/ . CPGRAMS is used for grievances relating to public authorities and provides a registration number for tracking.','Identity/contact details|Copy of application or service request where available|Acknowledgement or reference number|Relevant receipts or records|Correspondence with the department|Other supporting documents','Register the grievance through the appropriate government grievance mechanism|Keep the registration/reference number|Track the grievance status|Use the available appeal mechanism where applicable','Service/request reference available|Relevant department communication attached|Supporting documents attached|Grievance registration number saved|Status tracking details recorded'),('women','Women Safety Complaint','bi-shield-check','#db2777','TEMPLATE',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-02 18:13:57','WOMEN SAFETY COMPLAINT\n\nDate: {date}\n\nTo,\nThe Concerned Police / Protection Authority,\n{city}\n\nSubject: Women Safety Complaint - {subject}\n\nDear Sir/Madam,\n\nI, {name}, residing at {address}, wish to report an incident affecting my safety.\n\nDetails of the incident:\n\n{details}\n\nIncident Date: {incident_date}\n\nAdditional Information:\n{extra}\n\nI request appropriate protection, assistance and action according to the nature of the incident and applicable law.\n\nContact: {contact}\nEmail: {email}\n\nThank you.\n\nYours faithfully,\n{name}','Depending on the nature and urgency of the incident, contact the local police or emergency services. Women affected by violence may also seek support through the Women Helpline 181 and One Stop Centre services. For domestic violence matters, legal remedies may also be available through the Protection Officer or Magistrate process.','Identity proof where appropriate|Copy of complaint|Medical records where applicable|Photographs, messages or other evidence|Details of witnesses where available|Any previous complaint or reference details','In an emergency contact the appropriate emergency/police service immediately|Seek medical assistance where required|Preserve available evidence|Contact Women Helpline 181 or a One Stop Centre for support where appropriate|Seek legal assistance when required','Complaint copy ready|Important evidence preserved|Medical records attached where applicable|Witness details recorded where available|Emergency/support contact information noted'),('workplace','Workplace Complaint','bi-briefcase','#f59e0b','TEMPLATE',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-02 18:13:57','WORKPLACE COMPLAINT\n\nDate: {date}\n\nTo,\nThe Internal Committee / Appropriate Workplace Authority,\n{city}\n\nSubject: Workplace Complaint - {subject}\n\nDear Sir/Madam,\n\nI, {name}, wish to submit a complaint concerning the following workplace matter:\n\n{details}\n\nIncident Date: {incident_date}\n\nAdditional Information:\n{extra}\n\nI request that the matter be examined and dealt with through the appropriate workplace grievance or complaint mechanism.\n\nContact: {contact}\nEmail: {email}\n\nThank you.\n\nYours faithfully,\n{name}','For a sexual-harassment complaint covered by the Sexual Harassment of Women at Workplace Act, 2013, a workplace with the required applicability should have an Internal Committee. Where an Internal Committee is not constituted because the establishment has fewer than ten workers, or where the complaint is against the employer, the Local Committee mechanism applies.','Identity/contact details|Written complaint|Incident dates and description|Relevant emails, messages or other records|Names/details of witnesses where available|Other supporting evidence','Submit the complaint to the appropriate Internal Committee or Local Committee mechanism as applicable|Keep a copy of the complaint|Preserve supporting records and evidence|Record the acknowledgement/reference received','Written complaint ready|Incident details recorded|Relevant communications attached|Witness details recorded where available|Acknowledgement/reference saved');
