INSERT INTO `skill_development` VALUES (1,1,'Electrical Safety & Basic Electrical Concepts','Beginner','Learn electrical hazards, safe working practices, basic electrical concepts, and the importance of using appropriate protective equipment before working on electrical systems.','Electrical safety is the foundation of an electrician’s work and helps prevent electric shock, short circuits, burns, and other workplace accidents.','Understand basic electrical concepts → identify electrical hazards → learn safe working practices → understand protective equipment → apply safety precautions.','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vYXClYyZYo0'),(2,1,'Basic Wiring & Distribution Board Work','Intermediate','Learn practical house wiring concepts and understand the main distribution board, wiring connections, circuit protection, and safe electrical installation practices.','Wiring and distribution-board work are essential practical skills for electricians working on residential and small commercial electrical installations.','Understand wiring diagrams → learn wire and connection basics → understand MCB and distribution boards → practise basic wiring → follow safe installation procedures.','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=M8YrsyOpCao'),(3,1,'Electrical Panel Wiring & Troubleshooting','Advanced','Develop advanced practical skills in electrical panel wiring, control circuits, troubleshooting, and understanding how industrial electrical panels operate.','Panel wiring and troubleshooting allow experienced electricians to handle more complex installations, maintenance work, and industrial electrical systems.','Read electrical diagrams → understand control circuits → learn panel wiring → practise fault identification → develop systematic troubleshooting skills.','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6SmzANfIE40'),(4,2,'Pipe Fitting & Measurement Basics','Beginner','Learn how to identify common plumbing pipes and fittings, take accurate measurements, understand fitting dimensions, and make basic pipe connections.','Accurate measurement and correct pipe fitting are fundamental plumbing skills. Mistakes at this stage can lead to poor connections, leaks, and material wastage.','Identify pipes and fittings → learn basic measurements → understand fitting dimensions → practise cutting and joining → check connections for proper fit.','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zE2YP9NqTAw'),(5,2,'Leak Detection & Repair','Intermediate','Learn a systematic approach to identifying water leaks, checking water pressure, isolating sections of a plumbing system, and locating visible or hidden leaks.','Quick and accurate leak detection helps prevent water damage, reduces repair time, and improves the quality of plumbing service.','Understand common leak symptoms → check the system and water pressure → isolate the affected section → locate the leak → repair and test the plumbing system.','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9bW1w-ya2D4'),(6,2,'Bathroom Plumbing & Fixture Installation','Advanced','Learn practical bathroom plumbing work including pipe connections and installation of common fixtures such as sinks, toilets, showers, and associated fittings.','Bathroom installation is a valuable specialization for plumbers because it combines water supply, drainage, fixture connections, testing, and finishing work.','Plan the plumbing layout → prepare water supply and drainage connections → install fixtures → check joints and seals → test the complete system for leaks and proper drainage.','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xgf0tEW08bY'),(7,3,'Carpentry Tools, Measurement & Safety','Beginner','Learn the safe use of common carpentry hand tools and basic power tools, accurate measurement and marking, correct handling of timber and safe workshop practices.','Accurate measurement and safe tool handling are the foundation of quality carpentry and help prevent injuries, material wastage and inaccurate work.','Learn tool identification → understand tool safety → practise measuring and marking → learn basic cutting techniques → maintain tools properly.','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DYmXXvB6cps'),(8,3,'Wood Joinery & Furniture Construction','Intermediate','Learn common woodworking joints and practical furniture-construction techniques, including accurate cutting, joining, alignment and assembly of wooden components.','Strong and accurate joints are essential for producing durable furniture and professional-quality carpentry work.','Understand wood grain and measurements → learn basic joints → practise accurate cutting → assemble components → check strength and alignment → improve finishing quality.','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nZFXHr7f7R4'),(9,3,'Modular Furniture & Kitchen Installation','Advanced','Develop practical skills for modular furniture and kitchen work, including measurement of the installation area, cabinet components, alignment, hardware fitting and on-site installation.','Modular furniture and kitchen installation can provide carpenters with higher-value residential work and opportunities to work with interior contractors and homeowners.','Understand modular layouts → measure the installation site → learn cabinet and hardware concepts → practise assembly and alignment → install units → check finishing and functionality.','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2brwVeDeh-0'),(10,4,'Surface Preparation & Priming','Beginner','Learn how to prepare walls and other surfaces before painting by cleaning, repairing minor imperfections, sanding, and applying suitable primer.','Proper surface preparation improves paint adhesion, finish quality and durability and helps prevent problems such as peeling and uneven coverage.','Inspect the surface → clean and repair imperfections → sand the surface → apply suitable primer → allow proper drying before painting.','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jcpWB5QYJDU'),(11,4,'Professional Painting Techniques','Intermediate','Learn correct brush and roller handling, paint loading, controlled strokes, edge cutting, even coverage and application of multiple coats for a professional finish.','Good painting technique directly affects the appearance, consistency and efficiency of a painting job and helps reduce streaks, drips and uneven coverage.','Select suitable tools → prepare the paint → practise brush and roller techniques → apply controlled strokes → maintain even coverage → apply additional coats when required.','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HMHGy_7QL8c'),(12,4,'Texture Painting & Decorative Finishes','Advanced','Learn practical wall-texture techniques and decorative finishing methods using appropriate tools and materials to create professional interior wall finishes.','Decorative texture work allows experienced painters to offer specialized premium services beyond standard wall painting.','Understand texture materials → prepare the surface → select suitable texture tools → practise pattern application → control thickness and consistency → complete the decorative finish.','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7fcEygzfc3I'),(13,5,'Sewing Machine Operation & Measurement','Beginner','Learn how to operate and maintain a sewing machine, select suitable stitches, take accurate body measurements, and understand basic garment measurements.','Correct machine operation and accurate measurement are the foundation of properly fitted garments and help prevent stitching errors and material wastage.','Learn machine parts → practise threading and basic stitches → understand fabric handling → learn measurement techniques → practise straight and controlled stitching.','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ls4fHHEmqV4'),(14,5,'Garment Cutting, Pattern Making & Stitching','Intermediate','Learn how to convert measurements into basic garment patterns, mark fabric accurately, cut fabric according to the pattern, and assemble the pieces using appropriate stitching techniques.','Accurate cutting and pattern-based stitching are essential for producing garments with correct fit, shape and professional finishing.','Take measurements → prepare the pattern → mark the fabric → cut accurately → stitch garment sections → check fitting → make necessary alterations.','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=y4TIZ27BuUg'),(15,5,'Designer & Bridal Garment Construction','Advanced','Develop advanced garment-making skills for designer and bridal clothing, including detailed fitting, pattern adjustments, decorative construction and professional finishing.','Designer and bridal garments require greater precision and customization and can help experienced tailors provide higher-value services.','Improve fitting techniques → study advanced patterns → practise detailed garment construction → learn decorative finishing → develop customized designs → complete final fitting and finishing.','https://www.youtube.com/@TailorBroAcademy'),(16,6,'Skin Care, Hygiene & Basic Facial','Beginner','Learn basic skin-care procedures, client hygiene, skin preparation, cleansing, exfoliation and basic facial techniques while maintaining proper sanitation practices.','Good hygiene and correct skin preparation are essential for safe beauty services and provide the foundation for professional salon work.','Learn sanitation and hygiene → understand basic skin types → prepare the client and skin → practise cleansing and exfoliation → learn basic facial procedures.','https://youtu.be/gZ01PAkFeHw?si=CsJxEA_YXKQ8WxZJ'),(17,6,'Professional Makeup & Hair Styling','Intermediate','Learn professional makeup preparation and application, including complexion preparation, basic eye makeup, blending, colour selection and complementary hairstyling techniques.','Makeup and hairstyling are core services that allow a beautician to handle everyday clients, events and professional beauty requirements.','Prepare the skin → understand face shapes and colour selection → practise base and eye makeup → improve blending → learn basic hairstyling → practise complete looks.','https://youtu.be/XIcFBij7kN8?si=j0qkr89MgcXxIhq_'),(18,6,'Bridal Makeup & Advanced Beauty Services','Advanced','Develop advanced skills for bridal and special-occasion makeup, including detailed skin preparation, long-lasting makeup techniques, advanced eye makeup, hairstyle coordination and professional finishing.','Bridal and special-event services require higher precision and customization and can provide experienced beauticians with higher-value professional opportunities.','Improve skin preparation → practise advanced base techniques → learn detailed eye and lip makeup → develop bridal hairstyles → create complete bridal looks → improve speed and professional finishing.','https://youtu.be/hOQRo7jx9GE?si=93i8FOw8iiwab32L'),(19,7,'Refrigeration Cycle & AC Fundamentals','Beginner','Learn how an air-conditioning system works, including the compressor, condenser, expansion device, evaporator, refrigerant flow and the basic refrigeration cycle.','Understanding the refrigeration cycle is essential before performing AC servicing, diagnosis or repair because it helps technicians understand how each component contributes to cooling.','Understand the refrigeration cycle → identify the main components → learn their functions → understand basic pressure and temperature concepts → relate the cycle to practical AC operation.','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dtuQmaqMx60'),(20,7,'AC Servicing & Fault Diagnosis','Intermediate','Learn systematic AC servicing and basic fault diagnosis, including checking airflow, filters, cooling performance, electrical components, sensors and common causes of poor cooling.','Systematic diagnosis helps technicians identify the actual cause of an AC problem instead of replacing parts unnecessarily.','Learn preventive servicing → inspect airflow and filters → check electrical and mechanical components → observe cooling symptoms → identify likely faults → test the system after servicing.','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mc8tnEymAys'),(21,7,'Inverter AC Troubleshooting & PCB Basics','Advanced','Develop advanced skills in diagnosing inverter AC faults, understanding error indications, checking electronic control components and performing basic PCB-level troubleshooting.','Modern inverter ACs use electronic control systems, so advanced technicians need additional diagnostic skills to handle electronic faults and provide higher-value repair services.','Understand inverter AC operation → learn common error indications → study PCB and sensor functions → practise electrical testing → diagnose electronic faults → follow safe repair and testing procedures.','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=p0g3KPN0whg'),(22,8,'Vehicle Systems & Workshop Safety','Beginner','Learn the basic systems of a vehicle, identify major engine and vehicle components, understand common workshop tools, and follow essential workshop safety practices.','Understanding the major vehicle systems and safe workshop practices provides the foundation for performing maintenance and repairs without damaging components or causing injury.','Learn workshop safety → identify vehicle components → understand engine basics → learn common hand tools → practise basic inspection procedures.','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fPjOWekzeGI'),(23,8,'Engine, Brake & Basic Maintenance','Intermediate','Learn practical vehicle maintenance and repair skills including basic engine servicing, brake-system inspection, oil and filter replacement, and identification of common mechanical problems.','Engine and brake maintenance are among the most common services performed by mechanics and are essential for vehicle reliability and safety.','Understand routine maintenance → learn engine-service procedures → inspect brake components → identify common faults → perform basic repairs → test the vehicle after servicing.','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uE2dJWnPCT8'),(24,8,'Vehicle Diagnostics & Electronic Systems','Advanced','Develop advanced diagnostic skills for modern vehicles, including electronic control systems, sensors, diagnostic trouble codes and systematic fault diagnosis using suitable diagnostic equipment.','Modern vehicles rely heavily on electronic control systems, so diagnostic skills allow mechanics to identify complex faults and provide higher-value repair services.','Understand vehicle electronics → learn sensor and ECU functions → understand diagnostic trouble codes → use an OBD scanner → interpret diagnostic information → perform systematic fault diagnosis.','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TN9ZyIW_ZJg'),(25,9,'Refrigeration Fundamentals & Safety','Beginner','Learn the basic refrigeration cycle, identify the compressor, condenser, evaporator and expansion components, and understand essential electrical and refrigerant safety practices.','Understanding how refrigeration works is the foundation for diagnosing and servicing refrigerators safely and correctly.','Understand the refrigeration cycle → identify major components → learn their functions → understand basic electrical safety → learn safe refrigerant-handling principles.','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dtuQmaqMx60'),(26,9,'Compressor, Electrical & Refrigeration Servicing','Intermediate','Learn practical refrigerator servicing, including compressor operation, relay and overload components, electrical testing, cooling-system inspection and identification of common refrigeration faults.','Compressor and electrical-system knowledge is essential because these components are involved in many common refrigerator failures.','Understand compressor operation → identify relay and overload components → learn electrical testing → inspect the refrigeration system → identify common faults → perform systematic servicing.','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NND8J8dXqJ0'),(27,9,'Inverter Refrigerator Diagnostics & Electronic Controls','Advanced','Develop advanced skills for diagnosing inverter refrigerators, including inverter compressor operation, sensors, electronic control boards, error indications and systematic electronic fault diagnosis.','Modern inverter refrigerators use electronic controls and variable-speed compressors, so advanced diagnostic skills allow technicians to handle newer appliances and complex faults.','Understand inverter compressor operation → study sensors and control boards → learn error indications → practise electrical measurements → diagnose electronic faults → verify the repair safely.','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Yvn5IAyOjz4'),(28,10,'Washing Machine Fundamentals & Safety','Beginner','Learn the basic working principles of washing machines, identify major components such as the drum, motor, pump and inlet system, and follow electrical and appliance safety practices.','Understanding the basic operating cycle and major components helps a technician safely inspect a washing machine before attempting repairs.','Understand washing cycles → identify major components → learn their functions → understand electrical safety → practise basic inspection and fault identification.','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8016ywRXGPA'),(29,10,'Motor, Drum & Drain-System Servicing','Intermediate','Learn practical servicing of washing-machine mechanical systems, including drum operation, motor-related faults, drain pumps, hoses and common causes of vibration, noise and drainage problems.','Motor, drum and drainage problems are common service issues, so these skills are essential for routine repair and maintenance work.','Understand drum and motor operation → inspect belts and mechanical components → check the drain system → identify common faults → replace or repair faulty components → test the machine.','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=03ZEcgw6eOM'),(30,10,'PCB Diagnostics & Inverter Washing Machines','Advanced','Develop advanced skills in diagnosing electronic control boards, sensors, error codes and inverter motor systems used in modern washing machines.','Modern washing machines increasingly use electronic control systems and inverter motors, making electronic diagnostics an important advanced skill for appliance technicians.','Understand PCB functions → learn sensor operation → interpret error codes → understand inverter motor control → perform systematic electrical tests → diagnose electronic faults safely.','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Zj8c0BGt_Fo'),(31,11,'Welding Safety & Basic Arc Welding','Beginner','Learn essential welding safety, personal protective equipment, welding-machine basics, electrode selection and fundamental arc-welding techniques.','Safety is the most important foundation in welding because welding involves high temperatures, electrical hazards, fumes and sparks.','Learn welding hazards → understand PPE → prepare the work area → understand welding-machine controls → practise basic arc striking → create simple weld joints safely.','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=F3fDbL9MQ-Q'),(32,11,'MIG/TIG Welding & Joint Preparation','Intermediate','Learn the fundamentals of MIG and TIG welding, including material preparation, joint preparation, torch or gun handling, welding parameters and producing cleaner welds.','Understanding different welding processes helps welders select the appropriate technique for different materials, thicknesses and job requirements.','Understand MIG and TIG principles → prepare materials and joints → learn machine settings → practise torch or gun movement → control heat input → inspect weld quality.','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gc9fBVq9NlE'),(33,11,'Structural Welding & Metal Fabrication','Advanced','Develop advanced skills in structural welding and fabrication, including reading basic fabrication drawings, preparing structural joints, controlling distortion and producing consistent welds.','Structural fabrication allows experienced welders to work on higher-value industrial, construction and fabrication projects where accuracy and weld quality are critical.','Read basic fabrication drawings → understand structural joints → prepare and align components → select suitable welding parameters → control distortion → inspect weld quality → improve fabrication accuracy.','https://youtu.be/jkK2N4MNgXk?si=0s_eZGK6hrEcD5-B'),(34,12,'Fabric Care, Sorting & Washing Basics','Beginner','Learn how to identify common fabric types, read basic care labels, sort garments correctly, and select suitable washing methods for different materials.','Correct fabric identification and sorting help prevent colour bleeding, shrinkage, fabric damage and other common laundry mistakes.','Identify common fabrics → understand care labels → sort garments by colour and fabric → select suitable washing methods → practise basic fabric-care procedures.','https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=fabric+care+laundry+sorting+washing+basics'),(35,12,'Professional Ironing & Stain Removal','Intermediate','Learn professional ironing techniques for different fabrics and basic methods for identifying and treating common stains while protecting garments from heat and chemical damage.','Good ironing and stain-treatment skills directly improve the quality of laundry services and help workers handle garments more professionally.','Understand fabric heat requirements → select suitable ironing temperatures → practise pressing techniques → identify common stains → select appropriate treatment methods → inspect garments after treatment.','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=65AIeFWYnGs'),(36,12,'Laundry Finishing, Dry Cleaning & Garment Care','Advanced','Develop advanced garment-care skills including professional finishing, handling delicate garments, understanding dry-cleaning principles and preparing garments for safe customer delivery.','Advanced garment care allows laundry-service workers to handle expensive, delicate and specialised garments and provide higher-value services.','Understand delicate-fabric care → learn professional finishing → understand dry-cleaning principles → handle specialised garments → inspect finished garments → package and store garments correctly.','https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=professional+dry+cleaning+process+garment+finishing'),(37,13,'Haircut Fundamentals & Sectioning','Beginner','Learn basic haircutting principles, hair sectioning, controlled cutting techniques and basic blow-drying methods used to create clean and consistent hairstyles.','Strong haircutting fundamentals are the foundation of professional hairstyling and help a stylist create balanced shapes and consistent results.','Understand hair sections → learn basic cutting positions → practise one-length cutting → develop controlled scissor handling → learn basic blow-drying and finishing.','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WTxlI-lJzPE'),(38,13,'Hair Colouring & Professional Styling','Intermediate','Learn the fundamentals of professional hair colouring, including colour theory, underlying pigment, colour selection and basic styling techniques.','Understanding hair colour helps stylists choose appropriate colours, predict results and provide more professional colouring services.','Learn colour theory → understand underlying pigment → identify hair levels → select suitable colour → understand basic colouring principles → practise professional styling.','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AqHWFaBpkUU'),(39,13,'Keratin Hair Smoothing & Advanced Treatments','Advanced','Learn the principles and professional process of keratin-based hair smoothing treatments, including preparation, product application, heat-based sealing and appropriate aftercare.','Advanced chemical and smoothing services allow experienced stylists to provide specialised salon treatments and higher-value services.','Understand hair condition → learn treatment principles → understand product application → follow professional safety procedures → understand heat application → learn aftercare requirements.','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iiuUdVuCk7I'),(40,14,'Manicure, Nail Preparation & Hygiene','Beginner','Learn basic manicure procedures, nail shaping, nail preparation, cuticle care and essential hygiene practices for providing safe and professional nail services.','Proper nail preparation and hygiene are the foundation of professional nail services and help maintain clean, healthy and well-prepared nails.','Learn nail hygiene → understand basic nail structure → practise nail shaping → learn cuticle preparation → perform a basic manicure → maintain clean tools and workspace.','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rjPAKCrNhjo'),(41,14,'Gel Polish Application & Nail Art','Intermediate','Learn professional gel-polish application, nail-plate preparation, alignment, colour application and basic techniques for creating clean and durable nail finishes.','Gel polish and basic nail-art skills allow a nail artist to provide popular salon services with better finish and durability.','Prepare the nail plate → understand gel-polish materials → apply base and colour correctly → practise alignment → cure correctly → improve finishing and basic nail-art techniques.','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zgyFldjaP_w'),(42,14,'Gel Nail Extensions & Advanced Nail Design','Advanced','Develop advanced skills in gel nail extensions, including nail preparation, nail-form application, building the gel structure, shaping and creating professional nail designs.','Nail extensions and advanced designs are higher-value services that can help experienced nail artists offer specialised salon services.','Prepare the natural nail → apply the nail form → build the gel structure → shape the extension → refine the surface → practise advanced designs and finishing.','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ahof2dKproA'),(43,15,'Camera Settings, Exposure & Composition','Beginner','Learn the fundamental camera settings including aperture, shutter speed and ISO, along with basic composition and lighting principles for creating well-exposed photographs.','Understanding exposure and composition is the foundation of photography and allows a photographer to move beyond automatic camera settings.','Understand aperture → learn shutter speed → understand ISO → practise exposure → learn basic composition → practise framing and natural lighting.','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rf9wx6DUTn4'),(44,15,'Lighting, Composition & Professional Shooting','Intermediate','Develop practical skills in controlling and using natural and artificial light, improving composition, selecting suitable camera settings and producing consistently better photographs.','Lighting and composition skills allow photographers to handle different subjects and environments more professionally and consistently.','Understand light direction and quality → practise composition → control exposure → work with different lighting conditions → practise portraits and events → review and improve photographs.','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AzV_cJD8dLY'),(45,15,'Wedding & Event Photography','Advanced','Develop professional skills for wedding and event photography, including preparation, equipment selection, camera settings, lighting, posing, shot planning, image selection, editing and client delivery.','Wedding and event photography requires technical skill, planning and the ability to work under changing conditions, making it a valuable advanced specialization.','Prepare equipment → plan the event → create a shot list → manage lighting → photograph key moments → back up images → select photographs → edit → deliver the final collection.','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uRWPDMVAxHw'),(46,16,'Videography Fundamentals & Camera Settings','Beginner','Learn the fundamentals of video production including camera types, resolution, frame rates, exposure, white balance, stabilization and lenses.','Understanding camera settings and video fundamentals is essential for producing technically correct and consistent footage.','Understand camera types → learn resolution and frame rates → understand exposure → learn white balance → understand lenses → practise stable video recording.','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PxY9SswA5j8'),(50,16,'Video Lighting & Professional Shooting','Intermediate','Learn practical video lighting techniques, including three-point lighting, light direction, colour temperature and creating consistent lighting for professional-looking footage.','Good lighting is one of the most important factors in producing clear and professional video, whether shooting interviews, events or promotional content.','Understand light quality → learn three-point lighting → practise key, fill and back lighting → understand colour temperature → position lights correctly → practise professional shooting.','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=flc5iP0KwTg'),(51,16,'Cinematic Filmmaking & Colour Grading','Advanced','Develop advanced filmmaking skills including deliberate composition, cinematic framing, visual storytelling and colour grading for creating professional-looking video productions.','Advanced cinematography and colour grading help videographers create visually consistent and engaging films for commercial, event and creative projects.','Plan the visual story → develop shot compositions → practise cinematic camera movement → shoot with consistent exposure → perform colour correction → apply creative colour grading → produce the final video.','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=viq_vKkHH2w'),(52,17,'DJ Equipment, Setup & Basic Mixing','Beginner','Learn the basic setup and operation of DJ equipment, including controllers, headphones, tempo controls, channel levels and basic track mixing.','Understanding equipment and basic mixing is the foundation for safely operating a DJ setup and performing smooth transitions.','Understand DJ equipment → connect the controller → learn software basics → understand tempo and levels → use headphones for cueing → practise basic track transitions.','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fa3sLTn0Wek'),(53,17,'Audio Mixing, EQ & Compression','Intermediate','Learn fundamental audio-mixing techniques including equalization, gain control and compression to improve clarity, balance and consistency in a mix.','A sound technician needs to understand how to control levels and dynamics so that vocals, music and other audio sources remain clear and balanced.','Understand signal levels → learn basic EQ → identify frequency problems → understand compression → learn threshold and ratio → practise attack and release → balance the final mix.','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yi0J9JsRdI4'),(54,17,'Live Sound System & Professional Sound Engineering','Advanced','Develop advanced knowledge of live sound systems, including sound-system setup, system EQ, speaker management, signal flow and professional live-event sound optimization.','Advanced live-sound skills allow experienced technicians to handle larger events, troubleshoot sound problems and produce clearer and more reliable sound for audiences.','Understand signal flow → connect and configure the sound system → set appropriate levels → perform system EQ → identify acoustic problems → monitor the audience mix → troubleshoot and optimize the system.','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cU9BmupC62c');
